    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11549" root="خمن" body-key="x">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَمَنَ</span></b> , [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَمُنَ</span></b> ,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُمُونٌ</span>, said of [a
man's] reputation (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الذِّكْرُ</span>), <i>It was,</i> or <i>became,
obscure; i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَمَلَ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُمُولٌ</span>: and, said of
a thing, <i>it was,</i> or <i>became, obscure, unapparent,
hidden,</i> or <i>concealed:</i> whence <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَمَنَهُ</span> as syn. with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَمَّنَهُ</span>, q. v. (Msb.)

